cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Reciprocal I2 Relic Retention Public Replication Package"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the archived repository release."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Stanisic"
    given-names: "Nemanja"
    affiliation: "Singidunum University, Belgrade, Serbia"
    email: "nstanisic@singidunum.ac.rs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nstanisic1/wider-i2-reciprocal-reservoir"
abstract: >
  Public replication package for "Reciprocal relic retention
  in the Serbian DNA Project Y-chromosome register: evidence for a broader I2 patrilineal
  reservoir". The repository contains public source tables, deterministic
  preprocessing, numbered analysis scripts, result tables, and figures.
license: "MIT"
